note Preserve src/omega_gpu_hostmath.c operation order and its filed fdlibm constants.
fn av_pow2 k long to f64
if gt k 1023
ret bitcast f64 ulong 9218868437227405312
end
if lt k -1074
ret bitcast f64 ulong 0
end
if ge k -1022
ret bitcast f64 shl ulong add k 1023 52
end
ret mul bitcast f64 shl ulong 1 52 bitcast f64 shl ulong add k 2045 52
end
fn av_log x f64 to f64
